  "description": "<p>The inclusion of UWM ocfl-java <a href=\"https://github.com/uW-Madison-Library/ocfl-java\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/uW-Madison-Library/ocfl-java</a> introduced a dependency clash on commons-codec. We currently require 1.6 in the pom.xml but ocfl-java requires 1.13. As migration-utils only uses the library for a simple Base64 output, I suggest we upgrade the local requirement to match ocfl-java.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Update pom.xml to require commons-codec 1.13 instead of 1.6</li>\n</ul>\n",
